title: "Integrating Moral Values in Turkish EFL Classrooms: Teachers' Beliefs, Pedagogical Practices, and Students' Narrative Responses"
abstract: >-
  A mixed-methods study of moral values integration in English as a Foreign
  Language (EFL) classrooms in Turkey, combining questionnaire data from 50
  EFL teachers and 50 EFL students with thematic analysis of students' oral
  narrative reproduction tasks.
